(7659543, 1247605, 96815, '<td valign="top">I spent an hour or so shooting bubbles for this challenge... and never could get it quite right. So I totally appreciate your result, well done!</td>', 'I spent an hour or so shooting bubbles for this challenge... and never could get it quite right. So I totally appreciate your result, well done!', '2020-04-22 01:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
