(7660517, 1248230, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a piece of art. I like everything about it. The shapes, colors and lighting all come together to make an outstanding composition. My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'This is a piece of art. I like everything about it. The shapes, colors and lighting all come together to make an outstanding composition. My favorite of the challenge.', '2020-04-28 23:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
