(7660538, 1248188, 67145, '<td valign="top">I must apologize .. in my comment during voting I said to the red ribbon that it had an Irene look .. my brain must have been taking a holiday ..lol.. this is by far a much more recognisable Irene ..!!..<br/>CONGRATULATIONS on such a stunning and gorgeous image .. so deserving of a ribbon .. it truly lives .. :)</td>', 'I must apologize .. in my comment during voting I said to the red ribbon that it had an Irene look .. my brain must have been taking a holiday ..lol.. this is by far a much more recognisable Irene ..!!..CONGRATULATIONS on such a stunning and gorgeous image .. so deserving of a ribbon .. it truly lives .. :)', '2020-04-29 01:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
