(7660542, 1247661, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> I went back looking at the photos after I''d commented .. and saw this again .. and thought of you .. it is such an incredible image .. I could see this hanging in an art gallery anywhere in the world .. <br/>the low voters .. of which you had a few .. don''t seem to understand abstract or art when it hits them square in the face .. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Where is the like button ;)<br/> <br/>Thank you, abstracts up always very hard to vote on, its such a subjective genre.</td>', 'Originally posted by roz: I went back looking at the photos after I''d commented .. and saw this again .. and thought of you .. it is such an incredible image .. I could see this hanging in an art gallery anywhere in the world .. the low voters .. of which you had a few .. don''t seem to understand abstract or art when it hits them square in the face ..   Where is the like button ;) Thank you, abstracts up always very hard to vote on, its such a subjective genre.', '2020-04-29 01:23:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7660543, 1248163, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is amazing .. not something i could ever imagine creating or finding anywhere on this planet .<br/>did you take a spaceship somewhere and find this memorable assortment of shapes and colours in a far flung galaxy .. <br/>very original and different .. <br/>many congratulations on the fourth place ... even tho i think its cheating when you leave planet earth for your challenge entries . :)</td>', 'this is amazing .. not something i could ever imagine creating or finding anywhere on this planet .did you take a spaceship somewhere and find this memorable assortment of shapes and colours in a far flung galaxy .. very original and different .. many congratulations on the fourth place ... even tho i think its cheating when you leave planet earth for your challenge entries . :)', '2020-04-29 01:26:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7660544, 1247670, 67145, '<td valign="top">ps .. astounded by the 2 votes of 2 and 2 votes of 3 .. then i looked at a couple of the best scorers and they also got some very low votes .. i really feel that there''s a conflict of interest when you vote in a challenge you are entered in .. for some ppl thats not going to create that conflict and they are very happy to give credit where credit is due .. even if it may impact on their own image .. but in the case of a lot of the low votes in this challenge i would be so bold as to assume that they were cast by competition .. <br/>this is an ongoing debate .. but i really was blown away by the low votes on the ribbon winners in this challenge .. and yours .. :(<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-04-29 07:22:26.</i></td>', 'ps .. astounded by the 2 votes of 2 and 2 votes of 3 .. then i looked at a couple of the best scorers and they also got some very low votes .. i really feel that there''s a conflict of interest when you vote in a challenge you are entered in .. for some ppl thats not going to create that conflict and they are very happy to give credit where credit is due .. even if it may impact on their own image .. but in the case of a lot of the low votes in this challenge i would be so bold as to assume that they were cast by competition .. this is an ongoing debate .. but i really was blown away by the low votes on the ribbon winners in this challenge .. and yours .. :(', '2020-04-29 01:32:38.000000', '2020-04-29 08:22:26.000000', 0),
