(7660573, 1248135, 113411, '<td valign="top">Wow! I have not had 1''s and two''s and three''s in a few years!  Check out these scores and comments.  What a diverse community! Were I to do it again, I would title it and the funny thing is<br/>the title was an abstraction as this was taken at an art festival in Cefalu, Sicily several years ago. I thought people who voted  1''s and two''s<br/>and three''s to make a point were long gone.<br/> <br/>https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1248135<a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1248135" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/3000-3999/3021/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1248135.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/3000-3999/3021/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1248135.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/3000-3999/3021/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1248135.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Wow! I have not had 1''s and two''s and three''s in a few years!  Check out these scores and comments.  What a diverse community! Were I to do it again, I would title it and the funny thing isthe title was an abstraction as this was taken at an art festival in Cefalu, Sicily several years ago. I thought people who voted  1''s and two''sand three''s to make a point were long gone. https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1248135', '2020-04-29 03:35:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7660576, 1248252, 67145, '<td valign="top">i can see that more than you and i loved this image ... i can see two 8''s and 4 x 7''s ... <br/>if i give a vote so high i just have to comment and let the person know why i appreciated their photo .. <br/>but we are all different ... <br/>i really do think this would look amazing printed ... probably on canvas ... <br/> <br/>and while i''m here .. re.  the low votes .. if you look at the ribbon winners and some other amazing photos in this challenge they all got their fair wack of low votes .. of course we have to take into account ppl''s like and dislikes .. but sometimes its just plain weird .. and makes no sense at all .. <br/>unless there''s a conflict of interest .. and i do feel .. altho not everyone does .. that if you''re in a challenge then dont vote .. vote of course if you can overcome that conflict of interest  .. and some ppl may be able to give unbiased votes when they are in the same challenge and give what they feel the photo deserves .. but i feel many dont and mark down their competition .. it seemed particularly ruthless in this challenge .. could have been the subject matter .. <br/> <br/>i loved all the different textures and surfaces ... and the shapes and lines and contrast .. this is fantastic .. :)<br/></td>', 'i can see that more than you and i loved this image ... i can see two 8''s and 4 x 7''s ... if i give a vote so high i just have to comment and let the person know why i appreciated their photo .. but we are all different ... i really do think this would look amazing printed ... probably on canvas ...  and while i''m here .. re.  the low votes .. if you look at the ribbon winners and some other amazing photos in this challenge they all got their fair wack of low votes .. of course we have to take into account ppl''s like and dislikes .. but sometimes its just plain weird .. and makes no sense at all .. unless there''s a conflict of interest .. and i do feel .. altho not everyone does .. that if you''re in a challenge then dont vote .. vote of course if you can overcome that conflict of interest  .. and some ppl may be able to give unbiased votes when they are in the same challenge and give what they feel the photo deserves .. but i feel many dont and mark down their competition .. it seemed particularly ruthless in this challenge .. could have been the subject matter ..  i loved all the different textures and surfaces ... and the shapes and lines and contrast .. this is fantastic .. :)', '2020-04-29 03:47:51.000000', NULL, 0),
