(7660586, 1248188, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by IreneM:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> I must apologize .. in my comment during voting I said to the red ribbon that it had an Irene look .. my brain must have been taking a holiday ..lol.. this is by far a much more recognisable Irene ..!!..<br/>CONGRATULATIONS on such a stunning and gorgeous image .. so deserving of a ribbon .. it truly lives .. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Dear roz, your comments are always an absolute delight to receive and they certainly brighten my day ((Hugs)) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>you are truly a beautiful person Irene .. it shines thru in your photos .. <br/>quoting so you know I''ve read your lovely reply .. it brightens my day to know my heartfelt comments have brightened someone else''s ..xx.. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>xxx</td>', 'Originally posted by roz: Originally posted by IreneM: Originally posted by roz: I must apologize .. in my comment during voting I said to the red ribbon that it had an Irene look .. my brain must have been taking a holiday ..lol.. this is by far a much more recognisable Irene ..!!..CONGRATULATIONS on such a stunning and gorgeous image .. so deserving of a ribbon .. it truly lives .. :)   Dear roz, your comments are always an absolute delight to receive and they certainly brighten my day ((Hugs))   you are truly a beautiful person Irene .. it shines thru in your photos .. quoting so you know I''ve read your lovely reply .. it brightens my day to know my heartfelt comments have brightened someone else''s ..xx..   xxx', '2020-04-29 05:39:35.000000', NULL, 0),
