(7660764, 1248231, 53200, '<td valign="top">Gaby - <br/>Thanks for the compliment and your vote.<br/>I must also thank KarenNfld for her Blue Ribbon Winner in the 2011 Stripes challenge which I was trying to copy for a Stripes photo a day project.  So I placed a glass ball on top of an upside wine glass in front of some blinds.  My resulting photo was crap.  So I just started playing with it - flipped it - ran it thru Nik Viveza and Color Efex - nothing helped.  Finally decided to see what filters were in Smart Photo Editor and ended up with what you see know.  Remembered the DPC challenge for Abstract and thought it would work here too.  Probably should have centered it more - didn''t think about it until it was too late.</td>', 'Gaby - Thanks for the compliment and your vote.I must also thank KarenNfld for her Blue Ribbon Winner in the 2011 Stripes challenge which I was trying to copy for a Stripes photo a day project.  So I placed a glass ball on top of an upside wine glass in front of some blinds.  My resulting photo was crap.  So I just started playing with it - flipped it - ran it thru Nik Viveza and Color Efex - nothing helped.  Finally decided to see what filters were in Smart Photo Editor and ended up with what you see know.  Remembered the DPC challenge for Abstract and thought it would work here too.  Probably should have centered it more - didn''t think about it until it was too late.', '2020-04-29 20:07:39.000000', NULL, 0),
